WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:05.880
Several months later under the strong pressure of Shilang's army.

00:06.280 --> 00:12.160
Xuan Kingdom had to abandon Beiyu Pass and other lands north of the river and retreated to defend Tianhe.

00:13.440 --> 00:18.840
Shilang fought at Tianhe for half a year but could never advance a single step.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.600
Finally had to retreat north.

00:22.320 --> 00:25.680
Xuan Kingdom also suffered heavy losses in this battle.

00:26.480 --> 00:31.333
The loss of Beiyu Pass signaled that Xuan Kingdom had no hope of northern expeditions.

00:36.880 --> 00:38.600
The 36th year of Longwu.

00:39.440 --> 00:42.280
Sikong Yao, who had sighed looking north for decades.

00:42.560 --> 00:47.720
Finally died of illness in the capital, full of regret at the age of 57.

00:48.200 --> 00:49.680
Later generations called him.

00:51.000 --> 00:55.500
Emperor Xuanhuai.

